<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange</p>
<p>reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar</p>
<p>days ending Wednesday, July 2  used for cash settlement of CME</p>
<p>Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Wednesday	July 2  $80.87   up 0.20</p>
<p>Tuesday	  July 1  $80.67   up 0.10</p>
</text>
